  exploit (Z_div_mod_eq (unsigned y) zwordsize). apply wordsize_pos.\n./lib/Integers.v:- f_equal. rewrite Z.mul_comm. apply Z_div_mod_eq. apply Int.modulus_pos.\n./lib/Coqlib.v:Lemma Z_div_mod_eq: forall a b,\n./lib/Coqlib.v:  generalize (Z_div_mod_eq a b H1). generalize (Z_mod_lt a b H1). intros.\n./lib/Coqlib.v:  generalize (Z_div_mod_eq (x + y - 1) y H). intro.\n./lib/Coqlib.v:  generalize (Z_div_mod_eq (x + y - 1) y H); intro.\n./lib/Coqlib.v:  generalize (Z_div_mod_eq x y H) (Z_mod_lt x y H).\n./lib/Zbits.v:  rewrite Z.mul_comm. apply Z_div_mod_eq. auto.\n./lib/Zbits.v:    exploit (Z_div_mod_eq (Zpos p) (two_power_nat n)); auto. intros C.\n./lib/Zbits.v:      f_equal. apply Z_div_mod_eq. apply two_p_gt_ZERO; auto.\n./lib/Zbits.v:       rewrite <- Z_div_mod_eq. ring. auto. ring.\n./lib/Zbits.v:  intros. generalize (Z_div_mod_eq x y H). generalize (Z_mod_lt x y H).", "extras": {"command": "grep -r \"Z_div_mod_eq\" . --include=\"*.v\" 2>/dev/null", "metadata": {"exit_code": 0, "pid": -1, "username": "root", "hostname": "rack-ge107-ya-20250517193240", "working_dir": "/tmp/CompCert/CompCert-3.13.1", "py_interpreter_path": "", "prefix": "", "suffix": "\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]"}, "hidden": false}, "success": true}
