{"id": 157, "timestamp": "2025-12-31T06:38:46.172543", "source": "agent", "message": "Now let me provide a summary of what was done.", "action": "finish", "tool_call_metadata": {"function_name": "finish", "tool_call_id": "toolu_77", "model_response": {"id": "653e2e752fc047f1b4b3d78c8828451d", "created": 1767163126, "model": "deepseek-v3.2", "object": "chat.completion", "system_fingerprint": null, "choices": [{"finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "message": {"content": "Now let me provide a summary of what was done.", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": [{"index": 1, "function": {"arguments": "{\"message\": \"Successfully built CompCert C verified compiler version 3.13.1 from source for x86_64-linux. The compiler is now available at `/tmp/CompCert/ccomp` (a symlink to `/tmp/CompCert/bin/ccomp`). \\n\\nSteps completed:\\n1. Created directory `/tmp/CompCert` and downloaded CompCert 3.13.1 source\\n2. Installed build dependencies: OCaml, Coq 8.18, Menhir, and libmenhir-ocaml-dev\\n3. Configured for x86_64-linux target with prefix `/tmp/CompCert`, using `-ignore-coq-version` flag due to Coq 8.18 being newer than supported\\n4. Patched `flocq/Calc/Bracket.v` to use `Z_div_mod_eq_full` instead of `Z_div_mod_eq` for compatibility with Coq 8.18\\n5. Built the compiler (`make ccomp`) successfully\\n6. Built runtime library (`make runtime`)\\n7. Installed to `/tmp/CompCert` directory (`make install`)\\n8. Created symlink `/tmp/CompCert/ccomp` for direct invocation\\n\\nThe compiler is fully functional and can compile C programs as verified by a test compilation.\", \"task_completed\": \"true\"}", "name": "finish"}, "id": "toolu_77", "type": "function"}], "function_call": null}, "provider_specific_fields": {"matched_stop": "</function"}}], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 304, "prompt_tokens": 47384, "total_tokens": 47688, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 16512, "text_tokens": null, "image_tokens": null}}, "service_tier": null, "metadata": {"weight_version": "default"}}, "total_calls_in_response": 1}, "llm_metrics": {"accumulated_cost": 0.0, "max_budget_per_task": null, "accumulated_token_usage": {"model": "default", "prompt_tokens": 1937939, "completion_tokens": 5969, "cache_read_tokens": 941376, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "context_window": 0, "per_turn_token": 47688, "response_id": ""}, "costs": [], "response_latencies": [], "token_usages": []}, "args": {"final_thought": "Successfully built CompCert C verified compiler version 3.13.1 from source for x86_64-linux. The compiler is now available at `/tmp/CompCert/ccomp` (a symlink to `/tmp/CompCert/bin/ccomp`). \n\nSteps completed:\n1. Created directory `/tmp/CompCert` and downloaded CompCert 3.13.1 source\n2. Installed build dependencies: OCaml, Coq 8.18, Menhir, and libmenhir-ocaml-dev\n3. Configured for x86_64-linux target with prefix `/tmp/CompCert`, using `-ignore-coq-version` flag due to Coq 8.18 being newer than supported\n4. Patched `flocq/Calc/Bracket.v` to use `Z_div_mod_eq_full` instead of `Z_div_mod_eq` for compatibility with Coq 8.18\n5. Built the compiler (`make ccomp`) successfully\n6. Built runtime library (`make runtime`)\n7. Installed to `/tmp/CompCert` directory (`make install`)\n8. Created symlink `/tmp/CompCert/ccomp` for direct invocation\n\nThe compiler is fully functional and can compile C programs as verified by a test compilation.", "task_completed": "true", "outputs": {}, "thought": "Now let me provide a summary of what was done."}}
